{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12204460","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12204460","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1220446001:0":{"text":"スタントンさん、これからよろしくお願いします。","source_cn":"斯坦顿先生，合作愉快。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x760CC65D7AF4E3A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220446002:0":{"text":"信じられねぇ……お、俺、プロボクサーになったんだ！","source_cn":"简直不敢相信……我、我成为职业拳手了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64ABC341B4A6A9C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220446003:0":{"text":"ありがとう……俺……なんて言えばいいか分からないけど、力になってくれて本当に感謝してるよ。","source_cn":"谢谢……我……我不知道该说什么好，但真的很感谢你们的帮助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54C819D08C3F094A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220446004:0":{"text":"ルカさん、前に話してた「約束」の内容を教えてくれるか？","source_cn":"卢卡先生，你说过要我答应你一个条件，现在可以告诉我是什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01B22D1EFD6174F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220446005:0":{"text":"俺は自分を、そして俺を助けてくれたボスの見る目が間違ってなかったことを証明した。","source_cn":"索尼娅当年救了我，我已经证明了自己，证明了她的眼光没错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07EF45CF9038E19F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220446006:0":{"text":"お前はチャンピオンベルトをつけて俺に会いに来い。そして俺の見る目が間違ってなかったことを証明するんだ。いいな？","source_cn":"而你，你要拿着冠军的金腰带来见我，证明我的眼光也没错。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E4DA32471095B29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220446007:0":{"text":"分かったよ、ルカさん！絶対に……やってみせる！","source_cn":"我记住了，卢卡先生！我会做到的……我一定会！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF05416692297116A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220446008:0":{"text":"よし、それならすべきことをしてこい。お前が自分を証明する日を待ってるぞ。","source_cn":"好了，小子，做你该做的事情去吧，我等着你证明自己的那天。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19D489EF7AF5F1E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:拳击掮客希尔森":{"text":"ブローカーのヒルソン","source":"拳击掮客希尔森","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:地下拳手斯坦顿":{"text":"闇闘技場のスタントン","source":"地下拳手斯坦顿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"ルカ","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}